// AWS EC2 Startup Shell Script Change | T1059.001, T1059.003, T1059.004 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/cloud/aws/cloudtrail/aws_ec2_startup_script_change.yml
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where eventSource=="ec2.amazonaws.com" and requestParameters.attribute=="userData" and eventName=="ModifyInstanceAttribute"
